{"seq":8,"slug":"information-technology","title":"五年级信息科技","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology","introMarkdown":"# 五年级信息科技 简介\n\n五年级信息科技面向十至十一岁已初步掌握图形化编程的学生，是小学信息技术课程中从基础操作走向项目实践和前沿认知的高级阶段。这一年的核心任务是提升编程的复杂度、培养数据处理意识，并初步接触人工智能与机器人的基本概念。\n\n本内容共包含四个章节。第一章**进阶编程**，在图形化编程的基础上引入自定义函数、变量和列表等概念，引导学生设计包含多个角色交互的复杂动画或游戏项目，培养模块化思维和程序调试的基本能力。第二章**数据处理**，教授学生使用电子表格进行数据的录入、排序、筛选和图表制作，通过班级调查问卷分析、天气数据整理等实际项目，帮助学生理解数据收集、整理与可视化表达的完整流程。第三章**人工智能与机器人**，通过体验语音识别、图像识别等智能应用和简单的教育机器人编程活动，帮助学生理解人工智能的基本工作原理，激发对前沿科技的探索兴趣，同时引导学生思考技术发展与社会伦理的关系。第四章**AI 使用入门**，针对当下家家户户都有的 AI 工具，从十岁孩子的视角讨论\"AI 帮我做作业 ≠ AI 替我做作业\"这一关键区别，建立合理使用 AI 的边界感和对自己诚实的学习态度。\n\n五年级信息科技学习应鼓励项目驱动与合作探究。建议学生在课后与同学组队完成一个完整的编程项目或数据分析报告，在实践中体会分工协作和迭代改进的过程。家长可以引导孩子了解身边的智能设备，培养对技术的理性认知。\n\n本内容适合五年级学生信息素养深化、家长科技教育指导以及小学高年级信息技术教师教学参考。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"advanced-programming","title":"进阶编程","docCount":3,"url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/advanced-programming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"python-intro","title":"五年级信息科技 — Python 编程入门","url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/advanced-programming/python-intro"},{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithm-thinking","title":"五年级信息科技 — 算法思维","url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/advanced-programming/algorithm-thinking"},{"seq":3,"slug":"debugging-skills","title":"五年级信息科技 — 调试技巧","url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/advanced-programming/debugging-skills"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-processing","title":"数据处理","docCount":3,"url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/data-processing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-collection","title":"五年级信息科技 — 数据采集","url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/data-processing/data-collection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"chart-visualization","title":"五年级信息科技 — 图表可视化","url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/data-processing/chart-visualization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-analysis-intro","title":"五年级信息科技 — 数据分析入门","url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/data-processing/data-analysis-intro"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-robotics","title":"人工智能与机器人","docCount":3,"url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/ai-robotics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-concepts","title":"五年级信息科技 — 人工智能概念","url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/ai-robotics/ai-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"robot-programming","title":"五年级信息科技 — 机器人编程","url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/ai-robotics/robot-programming"},{"seq":3,"slug":"smart-applications","title":"五年级信息科技 — 智能应用","url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/ai-robotics/smart-applications"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"ai-usage","title":"AI 使用入门","docCount":3,"url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/ai-usage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-as-a-helper","title":"五年级信息科技 — AI 可以是你的小帮手","url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/ai-usage/ai-as-a-helper"},{"seq":2,"slug":"help-vs-replace","title":"五年级信息科技 — 帮你学懂 vs 替你写答案","url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/ai-usage/help-vs-replace"},{"seq":3,"slug":"be-honest-with-yourself","title":"五年级信息科技 — 对自己诚实","url":"/education/primary/grade-5/information-technology/ai-usage/be-honest-with-yourself"}]}]}